        "Helping children move, focus and thrive — at home, at school, and everywhere in between.",
        "Sensphere provides occupational therapy assessments and therapy for children and young people across the UK. We work alongside families and schools to turn everyday struggles — handwriting, sensory overwhelm, coordination, self-care — into everyday wins.",
        "School & home visits available"
      ]
    },
