      "text": [
        "Support built around your child",
        "Every child develops differently. We meet children where they are, with therapy plans shaped by their strengths, their family, and their school environment.",
        "Children & young people",
        "From toddlers to teenagers, including those with autism, ADHD, developmental coordination disorder (dyspraxia), and sensory processing differences.",
        "Families",
        "Parents and carers looking for clear answers, practical strategies, and a therapist who explains things without the jargon.",
        "Schools & settings",
        "SENCOs and teachers wanting practical, classroom-ready recommendations and staff training that actually gets used.",
        "Who we work with"
      ]
    },
